{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37557","headline":"访姨兄王斌渭口别墅 · 郑谷","name":"访姨兄王斌渭口别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枯桑河上村，寥落旧田园。\n少小曾来此，悲凉不可言。\n访邻多指塚，问路半移原。\n久歉家僮散，初晴野荠繁。\n客帆悬极浦，渔网晒危轩。\n苦涩诗盈箧，荒唐酒满尊。\n高枝霜果在，幽渚暝禽喧。\n远霭笼樵响，微烟起烧痕。\n哀荣孤族分，感激外兄恩。\n三宿忘归去，圭峰恰对门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}